<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Player guide directory" data-copy-zh="玩家攻略导航">Player guide directory</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Game Systems" data-copy-zh="游戏系统">Game Systems</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find every system by your current goal: growth, combat, business, minigames, guilds and story." data-copy-zh="按当前目标查找成长、战斗、经营、小游戏、公会与剧情系统。">Find every system by your current goal: growth, combat, business, minigames, guilds and story.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Choose by your current goal</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-progression">Character growth and timeline</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-combat">Combat, exploration and defence</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-business">Business, materials and services</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-minigames">Minigames and seasonal activities</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-guilds">Guilds, factions and story routes</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-optional-world">Optional installed world</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">按当前目标查找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-progression">角色成长与时间线</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-combat">战斗、探索与防御</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-business">经营、材料与服务</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-minigames">小游戏与节庆活动</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-guilds">公会、阵营与剧情路线</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-optional-world">需单独安装的可选世界</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="In-Game_Mechanics"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Buildings_.2F_Items_.2F_Objectives"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Buildings_/_Items_/_Objectives"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Minigames"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Guilds_.2F_Factions_.2F_Combat_Class"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Guilds_/_Factions_/_Combat_Class"></span><h2>Choose by your current goal</h2><p>Start with the overview for an activity, then use its detailed companion guides when you need exact costs or calculations. Inventory currencies, battle resources and relationship progress are separate even when their icons or names look similar.</p></section><section id="en-progression"><h2>Character growth and timeline</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">Alignment</a><p>Read the lead between your alignment counters, plan daily gains, and compare relationship, combat and reset effects.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, Dating and Intimacy</a><p>Build affection, follow personal routes, use relationship cards, and distinguish dates, commitment and character-specific experience.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">Pregnancy</a><p>Set your preference, complete the shared protocol, check each character’s readiness, and understand pregnancy timing and activity changes.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-body-modifications.html">Body Modifications</a><p>Find Tinker’s two workshops, compare all eight modifications, and budget each permanent upgrade.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones</a><p>Find all eight stones, understand their passive effects, and choose between bonding, mining enhancements and material upgrades.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-crystals-and-doomsday.html">Crystals and Doomsday</a><p>Plan Crystal spending, extend the timeline, compare both shops, and find reliable one-time and repeatable rewards.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-new-game-plus.html">New Game+ and Postgame</a><p>Check New Game+ eligibility, prepare your save, and see exactly which progress carries over or restarts.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-objectives-and-achievements.html">Objectives, Tutorials and Trophy Goals</a><p>Track all fifteen tutorials, claim their rewards, navigate the Quest Log, and check fifty optional trophy goals.</p></li></ul></section><section id="en-combat"><h2>Combat, exploration and defence</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">Combat System</a><p>Prepare for ordinary combat, choose skills, react to incoming attacks, and understand defenses, status effects and recovery.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-specialist-class.html">Specialist Class</a><p>Unlock Blademaster, Assassin and Sorcerer, earn points with the right actions, and understand independent ranks and bonuses.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon</a><p>Plan ordinary dungeon exploration: movement, floor themes, supplies, hidden routes, recruitment and Dragon Coins.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-infinity-dungeons.html">Infinity Dungeons</a><p>Unlock a separate endless dungeon, understand its progress and enemy traits, and plan the materials you want to earn.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-morrie.html">Morrie in the Dungeon</a><p>Find her dungeon encounters and follow the recurring route.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-exploration-and-gathering.html">Exploration, Gathering and Hidden Pickups</a><p>Choose gathering actions, prepare for search encounters and find repeatable flowers, pickaxes and one-time hidden pickups.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">Blacksmith and Forge</a><p>Find Gastoff, upgrade your equipment, forge five tiers of armor pieces, and plan construction costs.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense</a><p>Prepare your first defence, use the battle controls, and understand campaign clears, Infinite mode and banking rewards.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Tower Defense Army and Training</a><p>Recruit and train heroes, compare personal and Army EXP, choose equipment, and understand automatic special abilities.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-workshops.html">Tower Defense Workshops and Permanent Upgrades</a><p>Find each workshop, compare turret and barrier research, plan grenade upgrades, and improve shared defence facilities.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-battle-reference.html">Tower Defense Battle Reference</a><p>Check personal shooting, placement limits, enemy behavior, six campaign wave tables, Infinite growth and reward rules.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-reclamation-bay.html">Reclamation Bay</a><p>Unlock Orchid’s recycler, queue and undo items safely, compare material returns, and understand processing and Core Purity.</p></li></ul></section><section id="en-business"><h2>Business, materials and services</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Rose &amp; Thorn: Brothel and Hotel</a><p>Manage workers, bedrooms and apprentices, plan permanent improvements, and find the right room for each service.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel-stats-and-calculations.html">Brothel Stats and Daily Calculations</a><p>Read the daily report, understand worker passives and pay, and trace EXP, Stress, reputation, tax, upkeep and cleaning.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-maid-system.html">Maids and Cleaning</a><p>Acquire maids, train them and choose equipment for cleaning and business bonuses.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">Investments and Company Ownership</a><p>Compare all fifty businesses, plan five investment levels and the separate buyout, and collect earnings with the right timing.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Sirena Isle Resort</a><p>Reach the island, manage three vacation slots, find current activities, and spend Sea Shells on the right permanent rewards.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-caterpillar-rearing.html">Caterpillar Rearing</a><p>Collect and release native species, research five paths, and grow a lasting ecosystem across two eras.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-mining-system.html">Mining</a><p>Choose your tools, turn fragments into whole resources, and plan for Soul Stones, enhancement ore and Chronium.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-ruxandra-s-alchemy-shop.html">Ruxandra’s Alchemy Shop</a><p>Reach Blood Alchemy, decide how to use Blood Orbs, and compare six artifacts and two repeatable refinements.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-sylwithes-hollow.html">Sylwithe’s Hollow</a><p>Find the Hollow, check its services and reach its permanent-upgrade menus.</p></li></ul></section><section id="en-minigames"><h2>Minigames and seasonal activities</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie’s Love Training</a><p>Assign production, level characters, claim achievements and plan Rebirth.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-neural-targeting.html">Neural Targeting</a><p>Learn the shooter, compare eight upgrade tracks and unlock high-score prizes.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-bar-games.html">Bar Games</a><p>Find Vera’s four games, learn their controls, and distinguish winnings from the money returned with your stake.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-fishing.html">Fishing</a><p>Prepare your rod and bait, steer into fishing rings, learn the reel timing, and compare catches and permanent boat upgrades.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-music-and-rhythm.html">Music and Rhythm Games</a><p>Learn drum controls, all seven song unlocks, practice modes, calibration and the separate dance and duet score requirements.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-gym-and-archery.html">Gym Workouts and Archery</a><p>Compare the workout’s ten-second reward tiers, Robin’s four-target contest, aiming modifiers and match rewards.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-arcade-games.html">Cucker-Chucker and Invading Space</a><p>Learn farm aiming, Rei’s planetary conquest, match currency, upgrades, all four power-ups and difficulty-based rewards.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-haunted-mansion.html">Haunted Mansion</a><p>Explore both mansion chapters, distinguish revealing from collecting souls, and check puzzle controls, passage requirements and optional rewards.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">Christmas Village</a><p>Find seasonal activities, gifts and the current event route.</p></li></ul></section><section id="en-guilds"><h2>Guilds, factions and story routes</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-fighters-guild.html">Fighters Guild</a><p>Prepare for contracts, follow all twenty-six jobs, learn combat skills and understand what advances guild progress.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-thieves-guild.html">Thieves Guild</a><p>Find the night entrance and Hidden Chamber, join the guild, plan heists and compare the three-day item commissions.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-wizard-faction.html">Wizard Faction</a><p>Find the teachers, count Wizard Clout correctly, and prepare lessons, errands and the initiation test.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-bards-guild.html">Bards Guild</a><p>Learn to compose and perform, track unique songs and venues, and follow the current guild and Lily requirements.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-chaos-syndicate.html">Syndicate Story and Alliance</a><p>Navigate the Syndicate, follow its shared missions and alliance, and keep optional personal routes separate.</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story Guide</a><p>Find the next main-story location and time, check manual actions and prerequisites, and reveal later steps only when needed.</p></li></ul></section><section id="en-optional-world"><h2>Optional installed world</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-wildheart.html">Wildheart: Wild Woods</a><p>Install and enter the optional world, find all six characters and resolve eight shared-event prerequisites.</p></li></ul></section></div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-In-Game_Mechanics"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Buildings_.2F_Items_.2F_Objectives"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Buildings_/_Items_/_Objectives"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Minigames"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Guilds_.2F_Factions_.2F_Combat_Class"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Guilds_/_Factions_/_Combat_Class"></span><h2>按当前目标查找</h2><p>先看活动的总体玩法；需要精确费用或计算方式时，再查对应的详细指南。库存货币、战场资源与人物关系分别记录，不能只凭相近的名称或图标判断。</p></section><section id="zh-progression"><h2>角色成长与时间线</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">阵营倾向</a><p>看懂三项点数的领先差值，安排每日行动，查清关系收益、战斗效果与重置费用。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系、约会与亲密互动</a><p>提升好感、推进个人路线、看懂关系卡，并分清约会、交往承诺与角色专属经验。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">怀孕系统</a><p>设置偏好、完成共用规程、检查角色准备条件，并了解怀孕期间的时间推进与行动变化。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-body-modifications.html">身体改造工坊</a><p>找到 Tinker 的两处工坊，比较八条永久改造路线，查清等级上限、奖励与安装费用。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">灵魂石</a><p>收集八种灵魂石，了解持有即生效的加成，再选择羁绊、采矿强化或材料升级。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-crystals-and-doomsday.html">水晶与末日倒计时</a><p>安排水晶开销，延长时间线，比较两处商店，并分清一次性奖励与可重复的获取方式。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-new-game-plus.html">新游戏+与通关后玩法</a><p>查清新游戏+的开启条件、存档准备，以及属性、装备、关系和经营进度的保留与重置规则。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-objectives-and-achievements.html">任务、教程与奖杯目标</a><p>完成十五项教程并领取奖励，使用任务日志查进度，再按需查阅五十项奖杯目标。</p></li></ul></section><section id="zh-combat"><h2>战斗、探索与防御</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">战斗系统</a><p>做好开战准备，选用合适招式，掌握限时格挡，并看懂防御、异常状态与恢复。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-specialist-class.html">专家战斗路线</a><p>解锁剑术大师、刺客与术士，用对应招式积累点数，了解独立阶级与成长加成。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">地下城</a><p>规划普通地下城探索：看懂移动与楼层主题，备齐补给，查找密道、招募路线与龙币用途。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-infinity-dungeons.html">无限地下城</a><p>解锁独立的无尽探索，分清深度、敌人特性与材料奖励，再按目标安排挑战。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-morrie.html">地下城中的Morrie</a><p>查地下城遭遇条件，并按顺序推进这条反复出现的路线。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-exploration-and-gathering.html">探索、采集与隐藏拾取</a><p>按需要选择采集行动，为搜索遭遇做好准备，并查鲜花、采矿镐与一次性隐藏拾取的位置。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">铁匠铺与锻造</a><p>找到 Gastoff，升级基础装备，打造五级护具，并查清建筑委托的条件与费用。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">塔防</a><p>从第一场防御战开始，掌握部署与操作，并分清战役通关、无限模式、保存战果与返回游戏的规则。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">塔防军队与训练</a><p>招募与训练英雄，区分个人经验和军队经验，选择装备，并查清自动特殊技能的作用与培养方式。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-workshops.html">塔防工坊与永久升级</a><p>找到各个工坊，比较炮塔和屏障研发，规划手榴弹升级，并查清要塞设施的强化入口与费用。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-battle-reference.html">塔防战斗参考</a><p>查阅个人射击、部署限制、敌人特点、六场战役逐波表，以及无限模式成长和奖励规则。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-reclamation-bay.html">再生工坊</a><p>解锁Orchid的再生工坊，分清进料与撤回队列，比较材料产出，并了解处理流程和核心纯度。</p></li></ul></section><section id="zh-business"><h2>经营、材料与服务</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">玫瑰与荆棘：青楼与酒店</a><p>管理员工、卧室和学徒，安排永久升级，并找到训练、医疗、招募与日常经营所需的房间。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel-stats-and-calculations.html">青楼属性与每日结算</a><p>看懂每日营业报告，查清固有被动、工资、经验、压力与声誉，以及税、维护费和清洁的结算方式。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-maid-system.html">女仆培养与清洁</a><p>取得并培养女仆，选择清洁与经营加成装备。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">投资与公司收购</a><p>比较五十家企业，分清五级投资与另行买断的费用，并查清每日收益、风险和收取时机。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">塞壬岛度假村</a><p>前往塞壬岛，管理三个休假名额，查找当前活动，并按目标使用海贝壳购买永久奖励。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-caterpillar-rearing.html">毛虫繁育</a><p>收集并放归原生物种，研究五条方向，让现代与中世纪的生态随游戏日逐步成长。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-mining-system.html">采矿系统</a><p>选好镐、看懂碎片与完整资源，再规划灵魂石、强化矿和时源矿的开采。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-ruxandra-s-alchemy-shop.html">Ruxandra 的炼金商店</a><p>找到血液炼金商店，规划鲜血宝珠的用途，比较六件永久物品与两项可重复强化。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-sylwithes-hollow.html">Sylwithe的幽谷</a><p>找到幽谷，查清服务条件与永久强化入口。</p></li></ul></section><section id="zh-minigames"><h2>小游戏与节庆活动</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie 的爱之训练</a><p>分配生产、提升人物等级、领取成就，并规划重生。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-neural-targeting.html">神经瞄准</a><p>掌握射击玩法，比较八条升级路线，并解锁高分奖品。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-bar-games.html">酒吧小游戏</a><p>找到 Vera 的四种小游戏，学会操作与结算规则，分清本金、底池和真正计入进度的净盈利。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-fishing.html">钓鱼</a><p>备好钓竿与鱼饵，驾驶小船进入水圈、掌握收线时机，再查找渔获、收益和永久船只升级。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-music-and-rhythm.html">音乐与节奏小游戏</a><p>查架子鼓操作、七首曲目的开放条件、练习模式与校准，并分清舞蹈、合唱各自的分数要求。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-gym-and-archery.html">健身训练与射箭挑战</a><p>查十秒健身挑战的奖励档位、Robin四靶比赛、瞄准修正与比赛结算。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-arcade-games.html">打击鸡妖与入侵太空</a><p>查农场瞄准、Rei行星征服、局内点数、升级、四种道具与各难度奖励。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-haunted-mansion.html">闹鬼豪宅</a><p>探索豪宅两篇内容，分清揭示与收集灵魂的步骤，按需查找谜题操作、通道条件和可选奖励。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">圣诞村</a><p>查节庆活动、礼物，以及当前活动的推进路线。</p></li></ul></section><section id="zh-guilds"><h2>公会、阵营与剧情路线</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-fighters-guild.html">战士公会</a><p>为契约任务做好准备，按顺序完成二十六项工作，查找战斗课程，并分清哪些战斗计入公会进度。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-thieves-guild.html">盗贼公会</a><p>找到夜间入口与隐藏密室，推进入会和晋升，安排住宅窃盗，并比较耗时三天的物品委托。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-wizard-faction.html">巫师阵营</a><p>找到各位老师，正确计算巫师声望，并查清课程、跑腿任务与入会考验的前置条件。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-bards-guild.html">吟游诗人公会</a><p>学习创作与演出，分清不同歌曲和场地的记录，并核对公会与 Lily 路线的当前要求。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-chaos-syndicate.html">辛迪加剧情与联盟</a><p>找到辛迪加内部地点，依次推进共同任务与联盟支线，再按需查看个人路线。</p></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线流程</a><p>查找下一段主线的地点、时段与前置条件；后期步骤按需展开，避免提前看到剧情。</p></li></ul></section><section id="zh-optional-world"><h2>需单独安装的可选世界</h2><ul class="wiki-directory-links"><li><a href="game-systems-wildheart.html">Wildheart：野林</a><p>安装并进入可选世界，按头像找到六位人物，查清八项共同事件与路线前置。</p></li></ul></section></div><p class="starter-credits"><span data-copy-en="Adapted and updated from the community Chronoromancer Wiki. " data-copy-zh="参考社区 Chronoromancer Wiki 整理并更新。">Adapted and updated from the community Chronoromancer Wiki. </span><a data-copy-en="Community source and history" data-copy-zh="社区原页与历史" href="https://chronoromancer.miraheze.org/wiki/Game_Systems" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Community source and history</a> · <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" rel="license">CC BY-SA 4.0</a><span data-copy-en=". Game images © Chronoromancer Studio." data-copy-zh="。游戏图片 © Chronoromancer Studio。">. Game images © Chronoromancer Studio.</span></p></article>
</div></section>
